WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.437
– Maria, can I talk to you for a bit?
– Yes, go ahead.

2
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:21.119
I've noticed you've been quieter,
a bit more withdrawn since the accident.

3
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.273
I wanted to know how you are.

4
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.630
It hasn't been easy.

5
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.557
Do you want to share how
you've felt since the accident?

6
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.066
It's always on my mind,
I can't stop thinking about it.

7
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.218
And I've already made mistakes
I don't normally make.

8
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.437
I can imagine,
it can't have been easy to witness that.

9
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.957
But the truth is, the reaction
you're having is very common

10
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.837
when we're present at a moment like that.

11
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.744
There's nothing wrong with you.

12
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.496
Yes, but it's affecting my work.

13
00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.156
What do you think is hardest for you?

14
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.177
Is it being here, in the same workplace,
or is it the workload?

15
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.417
I think it's a bit of both.

16
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.097
I can't focus.

17
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.617
It's not a lack of focus.

18
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.657
It's a natural reaction
to what you went through, what you saw.

19
00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:13.152
What do you think we can do to make
things a bit lighter for you right now?

20
00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:17.777
If it makes sense to you, MC has several
ways of giving you psychological support.

21
00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:21.481
And, if you like,
I can help you get in touch.

22
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.215
You don't have to go
through this alone, ok?

23
00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.919
Thank you, really.

24
00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.327
Over the next few days, we'll follow up

25
00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.347
to see if the strategies are working and,

26
00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:34.113
if you feel you need something
before then, just tell me, ok?

27
00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.460
Ok.
